    <comment>New package python-sglang 0.5.17 (devel: science:machinelearning). CPU singlespec (python313), alts for the sglang CLI. pluskalm is the science:machinelearning/python-sglang package maintainer.

INTERDEPENDENT REQUESTS — please stage together:
* sr#1372971 python-blobfile
* sr#1372972 python-easydict
* sr#1372973 python-timm 1.0.16
* sr#1372976 python-torchao 0.17.0
* sr#1372989 python-gguf
* sr#1372990 python-modelscope-hub
* sr#1372992 python-modelscope

- Initial package of python-sglang 0.5.17 
* GitHub v0.5.17 tag (PyPI ships wheels only)
* Add sglang-relax-cpu-requirements.patch: relax
transformers/openai/xgrammar, drop unpackaged
CPU-inappropriate deps
* Add sglang-cpu-triton-stub.patch
* Build Rust PyO3 extensions (multimodal, grpc)
* Add sglang-cpu-rust-exts.patch
* Add sglang-grpc-system-protoc.patch
* Add vendor.tar.zst
* CARGO_HOME vendor remap (setuptools-rust runs from python/)
* sglang-server not built: dynamo-protocols 5.3.1 added
ChatCompletionTokenLogprob.token_id
* libalternatives (alts) for the sglang CLI</comment>
